+# Voids and Refunds
+
+Section: Voids & Refunds
+Roles: Admin, Manager
+Permission: order.refund
+Screen: refunds
+Keywords: voids and refunds, voids & refunds, ServOS
+
+## Overview
+
+Money reversal and stock disposition are separate decisions.
