+# Glossary
+
+Section: Glossary
+Roles: Admin, Manager, Server
+Permission: help.view
+Screen: help
+Keywords: glossary, glossary, ServOS
+
+## Overview
+
+Common ServOS terms used throughout the product.
+
+## Procedure
+
